From 23d54384126cb50a15058681d65408ecb3fc888b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shripad621git <shripad62001@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:52:31 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(esp32s31): enable br/edr in the bt controller

- Add the libbredr_app.a blob from esp32s31-bt-lib
- Build the BR/EDR controller port when BT_CLASSIC is set
- Run the controller in dual mode instead of BLE only
- Map the BR/EDR link and buffer options to Zephyr Kconfig
- Back the controller pool allocator with a Zephyr sys_heap

Build tested with samples/bluetooth/classic/a2dp_sink. Not run on
hardware yet.
---
 .../bt/controller/esp32s31/esp_bt_cfg.h       | 32 +++++++++++++-
 zephyr/esp32s31/CMakeLists.txt                | 14 +++++-
 zephyr/esp32s31/src/bt/bredr_mempool.c        | 44 +++++++++++++++++++
 zephyr/module.yml                             |  8 ++++
 4 files changed, 95 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 zephyr/esp32s31/src/bt/bredr_mempool.c

